s10-8-p7 : Block
s10-8-p7 = prose (cons "The same references support decentralized exchange. A peer can send a definition, its dependency closure, and its proofs; the recipient checks and uses them in its own context. The consequence of communication is not merely delivery of bytes but availability of a construction for further computation. A shared global namespace is unnecessary for definition identity; authenticity of external observations and machine semantics remain explicit premises. Distribution of programs and reuse of knowledge are thus instances of typed exchange." nil)
